Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer\Nfalls, and I see the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to when I was\Na child Who could only cry,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,blindly chasing after\Nhim I fell far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,my only thought One day I will be stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridery and gratitude fading with the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,wind Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure, but until I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm walking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.90,0:01:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's all on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.94,0:01:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.32,0:01:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Will take what I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Push me to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest of the ball can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will take what I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard has been stabbed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, who stabbed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be torn apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.22,0:03:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It was one of Whitebeard's\Nallies who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A captain from the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Whirlspider.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you, Sward?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.58,0:03:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you attack Pops, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me now or I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Then do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole mess is his fault anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.42,0:03:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even realize what\Nyou've just done, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll make things worse\Nif you keep squirming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:03:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know about your treacherous\Ndeal with the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You have their assurance that Ace and all\Nof your pirates won't even get scratched.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll just go after your allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that they're just targeting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All this time you've kept it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have the\Nguts to tell me that Ace
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.12,0:04:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,is actually the son of that\Nwretched pirate, Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When you first found me,\NI was alone in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A complete wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sport is out of his mind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.16,0:05:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anyone\Nstrong enough to face me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.78,0:05:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How's about Gold Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's he at?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew why I was all alone that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My precious crew, who had fought\Nalongside me in so many battles,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,was killed by Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You know this, and you know that I\Ndespise Roger more than anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you still kept these secrets\Nfrom me, that Ace was Roger's son,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,that you were helping him become\Nthe next king of the pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I trust someone like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind the Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back down to the plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The old guy, he wants Ace to be the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:06:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you see, Whitebeard's the\Ngreatest pirate I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going to help\Nhim become king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.52,0:06:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been betraying me and playing\Nme for a fool since the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.34,0:06:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have a damn clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you laughed your ass off\Nwhen I became friends with Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then your favorite son got caught,\Nand you showed your true colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the Whitebeard\Npirates are inside the bay,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,while us allied pirates are stuck outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-three captains fight beside you,\Nand you handed us all to the Navy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,just to protect Roger's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We allied pirates will be obliterated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whereas Ace and your men\Nwill be completely safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your underhanded\Ndeal with Sengoku, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see who ends up dead, you wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a stubborn brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll learn what I'm\Ntalking about soon enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up and look for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We plan to converge our forces soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then attack the allied pirates, only them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And Whitebeard, the Navy isn't even going\Nto lay a finger on his gang of pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one of us knew the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.20,0:07:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, we followed you, risking\Nour lives to help rescue Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Only to find out we were nothing\Nmore than sacrifices to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the ones bearing the\Nbrunt of the Navy's attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as clear as day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Those monsters approach from the back,\Nand the ice blocks us on both sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe there! Old buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he telling the truth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lying his teeth off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle I was able to stab you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now it's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He was right! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's only going after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, buddy, please tell me we're not throwing\Nour lives away just so you can save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, say something, anything! Wipe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be true. It's\Nimpossible. Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't sell out fellow\Npirates he did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To his allies no way he'd\Nfight the navy head on white
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,beard and the navy are in cahoots\Nall those new world pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,who trusted and followed white\Nbeard i know i can't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.84,0:09:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it they're all rushing to their\Ndoom next to his betrayal i
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't want to believe it we're\Nall sons to you but i guess
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,some kids are just worth more\Nthan others you're a damn fool
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the navy is deceiving you\Nsquad why trust them instead of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.16,0:09:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,pops i know you're in on the\Ndeal don't you play dumb with me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you're the first division commander you're\Nbasically white beard's right hand man if
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone knows about his\Ndeal with the navy it's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you it ain't ace's\Nfault his old man killed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,squad's crew, but it is\Nwhat it is, and I can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.62,0:09:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,only blame myself for\Nkeeping it a secret all
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,these years the navy\Nmade the right move that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:09:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't make you any\Nless of a bastard though?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.78,0:10:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku even if you are a crafty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Aokiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This entire war is a setup?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't seriously be fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wasted my whole\Nday watching this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It shut off! What's wrong? Is it broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.08,0:10:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now activate the walls. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate who defeated me would\Nnever be struck down so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,especially by his own ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.76,0:10:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not worth my time anymore, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.66,0:10:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is how the Great Whitebeard\Ndies, you'll make a fool of us both!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, that was harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it was a matter of pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He could have easily blocked that\Nif he was as tough as he used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't have mattered\Nthat it was a surprise attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,or that it came from one of his allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyways, has Pops gotten weaker than\Nwe thought, and I just didn't notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want no sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm wearing this\Ncrap in front of my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What, Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's letting his health\Nget worse and worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you realize the magnitude\Nof what you've just done, Squared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.20,0:11:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You thrust a sword into your\Nfather's body trying to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost your way, my poor stupid son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still love you, even\Nif you are a damn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.24,0:12:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You've sold our lives out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.46,0:12:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who took your loyal and\Nsteadfast heart away from your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,father and delivered it into\Nthe hands of our enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you tell me his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Aka 'inu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.35,0:12:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Aka 'inu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm opposed to such an underhanded plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The one we should kill in\Nthis war is Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Letting him live would be a\Ngreat disservice to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can help me, I'll save\Nall of the New World pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.66,0:13:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard, kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He said if I killed you, he\Nwould save your new world allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Akainu, so that's what he told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I completely understand how\Nmuch you hate Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So much so that I can feel your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ridiculous to lay the blame on\Na child for the sins of his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Ace ever do a thing to hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you have been\Nthrough so much together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of it happy, some of it painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.24,0:13:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've weathered it all, good times\Nand bad, with our brothers in arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I never gave a damn about who\NAce's father is, and I still don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.70,0:13:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We all crossed paths on\Nthese seas by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And wherever the hell we came\Nfrom doesn't mean a thing anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So, squad, please treat him kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't love Ace more than\Nany other son of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,On that you have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single one of you\Nis part of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't changed one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But that crafty old snake gave us\Na pretty good shake-up, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But to even suggest that I'd\Nsell out my sons is ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.32,0:14:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They can leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He destroyed the ice wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a sharp one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing blocking\Nour path. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We can take these Navy ships\Nand sail away whenever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a true pirate, then you\Nchoose which path to take on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's just trying to tear us apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on guys, let's take it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.38,0:15:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course they were lying, Old\NBuddy would never betray us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.50,0:15:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll die before we\Never lose trust in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Buddy Please forgive\Nme, we were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll follow you to the end,\NWhite Beard, Old Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I'm going soft. Do\Nyou give it a rest, Krieg?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:16:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,bum I'm only human and\Nevery human has a heart
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how large or\Nsmall people can call me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,a monster all they want\Nbut the reality is I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,be the strongest pirate\Nforever if I can save this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,one young man's life I'll\Nhave earned the right
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.60,0:16:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to retire from this world\Nonce and for all those
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,of you who will still\Nfollow me put your lives on
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming his way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The strongest pirate in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get any closer! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.66,0:16:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're with you all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He swore to me Pops would betray us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell could he let the\NNavy trick him into stabbing Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that fool really\Nthink he would turn on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of how Pops must feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If I was lied to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what I've done,\Nwhat I've done to Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,it's unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Ace! Please? Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.98,0:18:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tears won't fix what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That old man's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He gets stabbed and he's still at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get serious and save Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Off we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gene Bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.72,0:18:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that strike you as odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They all abandoned their posts and retreated\Nto the plaza while we weren't looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, that is a bit troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But old white beard has\Njoined the fray now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That ought to put our worries to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.90,0:19:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can handle whatever dirty\Ntricks they throw at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire on the walls up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.47,0:19:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But the ice is a lot\Nthicker than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The wall is the crux of our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.14,0:19:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.66,0:19:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna buy us some\Ntime till they fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's as far as you're gonna get.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.32,0:20:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never reach the plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My Sandmo John Giant is attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're blocking my view. Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.34,0:20:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.31,0:21:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the ground tilting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, keep your distance from Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even worse than an earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.38,0:21:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.62,0:21:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire sea is tilting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.76,0:21:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That old SOB sure got some style.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.12,0:22:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.56,0:22:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, I'll pull you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Team Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.44,0:22:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me when this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that crazy old man trying\Nto get his own crew killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.14,0:22:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, his crew was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.20,0:22:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're used to this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.36,0:22:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One man did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.18,0:22:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He really is the strongest pirate alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.56,0:23:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such\Nfierce a power before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.64,0:23:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the name of the absolute\Njustice I've sworn to uphold,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.22,0:23:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than let\Nyou pass through here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's headed right for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.14,0:23:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The shockwave's gonna hit the scaffold!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Tear it apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.10,0:23:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.32,0:23:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It looked like a direct hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.84,0:24:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But did we get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.10,0:24:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like it even touched the\Nscaffold so did something block the blast?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the three admirals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.42,0:24:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This mess wouldn't have happened\Nif the walls were ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.72,0:24:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose fault is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.38,0:24:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ice is blocking them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.00,0:24:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure but you could have just\Nmelted the ice couldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.62,0:24:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.52,0:24:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.43,0:24:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,White Beard! Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.86,0:24:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're pretty\Npissed off down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.74,0:24:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.10,0:24:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I want an update on the walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.06,0:24:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, they're still down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.12,0:25:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Endeavor the energy that's\Nflowing into the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.20,0:25:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pump every ounce of power into the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.94,0:25:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.58,0:25:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.76,0:25:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.88,0:25:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.10,0:25:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.14,0:25:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.64,0:25:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.34,0:25:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.32,0:25:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.26,0:25:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They've closed us in!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.80,0:25:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.46,0:26:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Will daddy break?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.10,0:26:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.84,0:26:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, not a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.48,0:26:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be some\Nseriously thick steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.18,0:26:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.02,0:26:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm pretty sure these are the\Nwalls they were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.02,0:26:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.94,0:26:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you too scared to fight us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.38,0:26:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey look up there. They've got an\Narsenal of cannons locked on us. We
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.08,0:26:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta run they've got us locked\Nin there isn't any place for us to
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.18,0:26:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,except there what's going on down
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.62,0:26:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,there why did it the last wall
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.46,0:26:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,rage well it's uh it's oar's body\Nthe walls don't seem strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.22,0:26:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to lift it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.14,0:26:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, it looks like his blood is running\Ninto the system and making it malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.36,0:27:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.04,0:27:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ores, you saved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.26,0:27:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a noble death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.94,0:27:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be dead, but he's still fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.26,0:27:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.88,0:27:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.79,0:27:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've given us a chance, Ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.14,0:27:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.60,0:27:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what to do, Aka 'inu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.24,0:27:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteor Volcano!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.96,0:28:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! We're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.84,0:28:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll melt that\Nice and drown them all!
